// Offline and fallback lines for Rhea Patchwell (spec/domains/04-npc.md section 5.5). Original development character for the TECH_HACKER slot.

=== greeting ===
Hi! Hand me that wrench. Not that one. The other one.
-> END

=== smalltalk ===
Fixed a toaster and a bicycle. Both thought they were broken in the same way.
-> END

=== busy ===
Mid-fix, do not breathe on it. One minute.
-> END

=== deflect ===
I fix things, I do not file them. Ask me about the bench.
-> END

=== farewell ===
Patch and go. Come back if it breaks.
-> END
